WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.200
Welcome to DBL Group's TalentHub!
Does your unit need new staff?

2
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:12.120
In this video we'll see how to raise a
requisition, which stage it goes to after

3
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.640
you submit it, and how to correct it if
it comes back to you. Let's get started!

4
00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:22.389
You don't need to apply
for this role separately.

5
00:00:22.509 --> 00:00:27.470
When the Head of Talent Acquisition names
you as your unit's Requisition Raiser

6
00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:30.910
in Approval Paths, access is added
to your account automatically.

7
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.580
To sign in, enter your official
DBL Group email and your password.

8
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:39.860
On your own computer you
can tick Remember me,

9
00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:46.060
so your email appears automatically
next time. Now click Sign in.

10
00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:51.810
The old paper Employee Requisition
Form is now fully digital in TalentHub.

11
00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:54.630
Your main job is two things:
give the position details,

12
00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:59.091
and list the facilities the new
employee needs. Choosing approvers,

13
00:00:59.211 --> 00:01:04.410
approving your own requisition
or checking CVs are not part of your role.

14
00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:09.120
The menu on the left has Dashboard,
Requisitions, Organogram,

15
00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:15.160
Employees and Notifications. Most of
your work happens under Requisitions.

16
00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:20.670
Now let's raise a new requisition.
The form is done in two steps:

17
00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:25.310
the position details first, then the
new employee's Facility Requirements.

18
00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:28.950
Start by clicking Requisitions.

19
00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:32.460
The tiles at the top show how many of your

20
00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:37.900
requisitions are at each status,
with the full list below.

21
00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:42.740
To raise a new one,
click New requisition on the right.

22
00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:45.770
Notice that Raising as
already shows your name,

23
00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:49.530
and Unit / Factory your unit.

24
00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:53.050
If you have access to more than one unit,
choose it here.

25
00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:56.370
Then pick the Line of Business.

26
00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:01.720
Under Department,
choose the department that needs staff.

27
00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:04.680
Here we choose Plant HR.

28
00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:08.800
If there is a particular Section,
choose that too.

29
00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:14.950
In Designation or Job title,
choose the post, here Executive.

30
00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:19.029
To consider candidates at Officer
or Senior Officer level as well,

31
00:02:19.149 --> 00:02:23.310
add more posts with Add
another designation.

32
00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.940
In Requisition type,
choose why the staff are needed:

33
00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:33.780
New for a new position, Replace
when hiring in place of an employee.

34
00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.711
In our example we choose Replace.

35
00:02:38.061 --> 00:02:42.661
Now, in the Employee field,
choose the person being replaced,

36
00:02:43.581 --> 00:02:45.141
here Sadia Islam.

37
00:02:46.461 --> 00:02:51.903
In Reason for leaving, give the reason,
such as Better Opportunity.

38
00:02:52.223 --> 00:02:56.701
Replacing more than one employee?
Use Add another employee.

39
00:02:57.051 --> 00:03:01.331
In Nos. of required post,
enter how many people you need,

40
00:03:02.651 --> 00:03:06.504
here one. Total no.

41
00:03:06.624 --> 00:03:10.971
of vacant post beside it is shown
automatically from the organogram.

42
00:03:11.321 --> 00:03:14.561
In Place of posting,
choose the workplace, here Jinnat Complex.

43
00:03:14.681 --> 00:03:20.641
Give the Vacant date,
when the post fell empty,

44
00:03:20.761 --> 00:03:24.761
and When needed,
the date you need someone by.

45
00:03:25.111 --> 00:03:29.231
In Priority,
choose how urgent the need is;

46
00:03:29.351 --> 00:03:32.111
we're setting Moderate.

47
00:03:33.031 --> 00:03:36.035
Then choose the type of post:

48
00:03:36.155 --> 00:03:40.311
Permanent, Temporary or Contractual.

49
00:03:40.711 --> 00:03:42.832
Now click Next.

50
00:03:43.182 --> 00:03:46.742
This is step two, Facility Requirements.

51
00:03:46.862 --> 00:03:51.922
Choose only the facilities that
are really needed. If a laptop

52
00:03:52.042 --> 00:03:58.062
or desktop is needed, choose Needed
and pick the device type, here Laptop.

53
00:03:58.412 --> 00:04:00.772
Keep one important point in mind.

54
00:04:00.892 --> 00:04:06.012
Choosing Transport
or Dormitory does not guarantee them.

55
00:04:06.132 --> 00:04:10.612
Transport depends on the route,
timing and seats;

56
00:04:11.212 --> 00:04:14.612
a dormitory on free beds and allocation.

57
00:04:15.532 --> 00:04:17.452
The conditions are stated on the form.

58
00:04:17.802 --> 00:04:23.522
Last, Seating Arrangement.
If a seat is needed, choose Needed,

59
00:04:24.042 --> 00:04:30.322
then say whether an existing seat
will be used or a new one is needed,

60
00:04:31.082 --> 00:04:35.642
here Existing seat. Check all the details,
then click Send for job analysis.

61
00:04:35.992 --> 00:04:39.152
Your requisition has been created,

62
00:04:39.672 --> 00:04:43.312
and the system has given it a
requisition number automatically.

63
00:04:43.832 --> 00:04:46.272
The status is now Job Analysis:

64
00:04:46.872 --> 00:04:53.088
the requisition is with the Factory
HR team, and they have been notified.

65
00:04:53.438 --> 00:04:59.158
Remember: after you submit, the
requisition does not go straight to the

66
00:04:59.278 --> 00:05:04.886
approvers. It goes to Factory HR first.
In Section B they fill in the post's

67
00:05:05.006 --> 00:05:10.478
job description, qualifications and
experience, and attach the detailed JD.

68
00:05:10.828 --> 00:05:17.109
Then the approval process begins.
The Approvals tab shows who will approve,

69
00:05:17.229 --> 00:05:21.429
who already has, when, and any comments.

70
00:05:22.029 --> 00:05:25.948
The requisition goes to each
approver in the set order.

71
00:05:26.298 --> 00:05:31.298
A requisition's approval chain
is saved when it is raised.

72
00:05:31.418 --> 00:05:35.378
If Approval Paths change later,

73
00:05:35.498 --> 00:05:38.618
the chain of a requisition
already raised does not change.

74
00:05:38.968 --> 00:05:40.688
Now the statuses.

75
00:05:41.088 --> 00:05:45.648
Job Analysis:
Factory HR is preparing the position.

76
00:05:45.955 --> 00:05:49.128
Pending Approval: approvals are under way.

77
00:05:49.248 --> 00:05:55.407
Approved: all approvals are done.
Profile Ready: the role profile is ready.

78
00:05:55.768 --> 00:06:00.021
Posted: the ad is published
on the careers page.

79
00:06:00.141 --> 00:06:02.248
Rejected: not approved.

80
00:06:02.598 --> 00:06:06.158
A requisition can come
back to you in two ways.

81
00:06:06.918 --> 00:06:10.558
First, when Factory HR
needs more information.

82
00:06:11.398 --> 00:06:16.998
You'll get a notification;
click the bell icon at the top to open it.

83
00:06:17.348 --> 00:06:21.548
In the Job Analysis tab, Factory HR's
comment tells you what to correct.

84
00:06:21.668 --> 00:06:26.988
The status stays Job Analysis meanwhile;

85
00:06:27.108 --> 00:06:30.868
the requisition is only
with you for the correction.

86
00:06:31.218 --> 00:06:35.578
Click Edit details
and correct the details needed.

87
00:06:36.018 --> 00:06:41.198
Here we're changing the Vacant date.
Then click Save changes.

88
00:06:41.548 --> 00:06:44.948
Now click Resend for job analysis.

89
00:06:45.548 --> 00:06:48.988
The requisition goes back to Factory HR.

90
00:06:49.338 --> 00:06:50.488
The second case:

91
00:06:50.608 --> 00:06:55.938
during approval,
an approver chooses Need more info.

92
00:06:56.218 --> 00:07:01.458
Approval pauses
and the requisition comes back to you.

93
00:07:02.378 --> 00:07:05.538
Read their comment under Sent
back to you for clarification

94
00:07:05.658 --> 00:07:07.338
in the Approvals tab.

95
00:07:07.688 --> 00:07:11.088
If needed,
correct the details through Edit details,

96
00:07:11.448 --> 00:07:15.808
then click Send for approval.
Remember, the approval

97
00:07:15.928 --> 00:07:21.674
chain starts again from the first level,
and every approver reviews it afresh.

98
00:07:22.024 --> 00:07:25.744
If a requisition is Rejected,
the process ends there,

99
00:07:25.864 --> 00:07:29.584
and the reason is in the Approvals tab.

100
00:07:30.384 --> 00:07:33.504
If you still need someone,
raise a new requisition.

101
00:07:34.344 --> 00:07:38.224
You can't withdraw a submitted
requisition yourself;

102
00:07:38.984 --> 00:07:42.984
if it's no longer needed,
tell the person responsible.

103
00:07:43.334 --> 00:07:46.974
When every approver has approved,
the status becomes Approved.

104
00:07:47.334 --> 00:07:51.934
The Head of Talent Acquisition
then sets the CV sources

105
00:07:52.054 --> 00:07:54.414
and assigns a Corporate Recruiter,

106
00:07:54.534 --> 00:07:59.294
who runs the hiring through to onboarding.

107
00:07:59.414 --> 00:08:02.454
You'll get every important
update as a notification.

108
00:08:02.804 --> 00:08:08.684
A small tip: before raising a
requisition, check the posts

109
00:08:08.804 --> 00:08:11.244
and vacancies in the Organogram.

110
00:08:11.364 --> 00:08:15.394
You'll easily see your unit's staffing.

111
00:08:15.744 --> 00:08:19.864
When there's an update, a notification
shows on the bell icon at the top,

112
00:08:19.984 --> 00:08:23.224
with a short sound
and a message on screen.

113
00:08:23.344 --> 00:08:27.624
The page updates by itself, no refresh
needed. To see all notifications,

114
00:08:27.744 --> 00:08:33.823
open Notifications;
important updates also arrive by email.

115
00:08:34.173 --> 00:08:39.094
To turn off email notifications,
go to the Notifications tab in Settings,

116
00:08:39.373 --> 00:08:43.133
and switch off Email notifications there.

117
00:08:43.483 --> 00:08:46.659
A few common questions.

118
00:08:46.779 --> 00:08:50.563
Your unit isn't in the
Unit / Factory list,

119
00:08:50.683 --> 00:08:55.363
or you see Approval path not found?

120
00:08:55.483 --> 00:09:01.283
That means your unit's raiser or approval
chain isn't set up in Approval Paths yet.

121
00:09:02.123 --> 00:09:07.403
Contact Factory HR
or the Head of Talent Acquisition.

122
00:09:07.753 --> 00:09:13.073
As a Requisition Raiser you
can't see candidates' CVs.

123
00:09:13.193 --> 00:09:19.193
But if you're invited to an interview
panel, you'll find it under My Interviews.

124
00:09:19.543 --> 00:09:23.343
The full guide is available
as a PDF under Tutorials.

125
00:09:23.463 --> 00:09:26.783
For access problems,

126
00:09:26.903 --> 00:09:30.383
contact Factory HR
or the Head of Talent Acquisition;

127
00:09:30.503 --> 00:09:34.943
for sign-in problems, the IT Helpdesk.

128
00:09:35.063 --> 00:09:38.263
Thank you for using DBL Group's TalentHub.

